# Ollama defaults qwen2.5-coder:7b to a 4096-token window even though the model
# supports 32768. Agent history passes 4096 within a few steps, after which Ollama
# silently truncates the oldest tokens — including the task description — and the agent
# flails without ever editing a file. See docs/FAILURES.md F5.
#
# 16384 is the compromise: ~0.9GB of KV cache on top of ~4.6GB of weights, which fits
# the 16GB budget alongside a 4GB Colima VM. 32768 would roughly double the cache.
#
# Build: make model

FROM qwen2.5-coder:7b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0
